<title>USA: Oakley sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Oakley sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakley Inc said Wednesday it declared a two-for-one stock split in the form of a one-share dividend per share of its common stock.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed October 10 to shareholders of record on September 25.</p>
<p>Oakley said it currently has about 35.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
